%% Sequence Diagram Template
%% Template Version: 1.0.0
%% Author: CORTEX Development Team
%% Usage: Use for API flows, request/response cycles, and interaction patterns
%%
%% Variables to replace:
%%   {{PARTICIPANT_N}} - Participant names (Client, API, Service, Database)
%%   {{ACTION_N}} - Action descriptions
%%   {{RESPONSE_N}} - Response descriptions

---
%% Basic API Request Flow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as 👤 Client
    participant API as 🔌 API Gateway
    participant Auth as 🔐 Auth Service
    participant Service as ⚙️ Business Service
    participant DB as 💾 Database
    
    Client->>+API: POST /api/{{ENDPOINT}}
    API->>+Auth: Validate Token
    Auth-->>-API: ✅ Token Valid
    
    API->>+Service: Process Request
    Service->>+DB: Query Data
    DB-->>-Service: Return Records
    Service-->>-API: Business Result
    
    API-->>-Client: 200 OK (Response)

---
%% Authentication Flow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant Client as 🖥️ Client App
    participant Auth as 🔐 Auth Server
    participant API as 🔌 API Server
    
    User->>Client: Enter Credentials
    Client->>+Auth: POST /auth/login
    Auth->>Auth: Validate Credentials
    
    alt Valid Credentials
        Auth-->>Client: 200 OK + JWT Token
        Client->>Client: Store Token
        Client->>+API: GET /api/data (Bearer Token)
        API->>API: Validate JWT
        API-->>-Client: 200 OK (Protected Data)
    else Invalid Credentials
        Auth-->>-Client: 401 Unauthorized
        Client->>User: Show Error
    end

---
%% Error Handling Flow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as 👤 Client
    participant API as 🔌 API
    participant Service as ⚙️ Service
    participant DB as 💾 Database
    
    Client->>+API: Request
    API->>+Service: Process
    Service->>+DB: Query
    
    alt Success
        DB-->>Service: Data
        Service-->>API: Result
        API-->>Client: 200 OK
    else Database Error
        DB-->>-Service: Error
        Service-->>-API: DBException
        API-->>Client: 500 Internal Server Error
    else Validation Error
        Service-->>API: ValidationException
        API-->>-Client: 400 Bad Request
    end

---
%% Async Processing Flow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as 👤 Client
    participant API as 🔌 API
    participant Queue as 📬 Message Queue
    participant Worker as 👷 Background Worker
    participant DB as 💾 Database
    
    Client->>+API: POST /api/{{ASYNC_ENDPOINT}}
    API->>API: Validate Request
    API->>Queue: Enqueue Job
    API-->>-Client: 202 Accepted (Job ID)
    
    Note over Queue,Worker: Async Processing
    
    Queue-->>+Worker: Dequeue Job
    Worker->>Worker: Process Task
    Worker->>DB: Save Result
    Worker-->>-Queue: Acknowledge
    
    Client->>+API: GET /api/jobs/{id}
    API->>DB: Get Job Status
    API-->>-Client: 200 OK (Status: Completed)

---
%% Webhook/Callback Flow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant External as ☁️ External Service
    participant Webhook as 🎯 Webhook Endpoint
    participant Service as ⚙️ Service
    participant DB as 💾 Database
    participant Notifier as 📧 Notification
    
    External->>+Webhook: POST /webhooks/{{EVENT_TYPE}}
    Webhook->>Webhook: Verify Signature
    Webhook->>+Service: Process Event
    Service->>DB: Update State
    Service->>Notifier: Send Notification
    Service-->>-Webhook: Processed
    Webhook-->>-External: 200 OK
